caf99f01-0000-7010-7f3b-db4628281f0d	93	Add Loren Market Julia warp	Makes Market Union Member Julia (547) a working warp NPC between Lorencia and the Loren Market, on both sides, instead of an empty merchant.	2026-06-24 00:00:00+00	2026-08-13 06:23:36.673936+00
caf99f01-0000-704d-046e-5a32f91f4837	15	Adds infinity arrow skill with quest	This update adds the infinity arrow skill as quest reward for 'Gain Hero Status (Muse Elf)'.	2023-08-28 20:30:00+00	2026-08-13 06:23:36.669928+00
caf99f01-0000-7059-9ac6-ab3eebae3969	79	Finish Dark Lord Master Tree PlugIn	This update completes the dark lord master tree skills and effects.	2026-04-14 16:00:00+00	2026-08-13 06:23:36.673205+00
caf99f01-0000-7073-c02b-e569f75facd7	59	Fix Event Items DropsFromMonsters Season 6	This update fixes event items that have DropsFromMonsters set to true, causing them to drop at level 0 instead of using their dedicated DropItemGroups.	2025-09-01 10:00:00+00	2026-08-13 06:23:36.672227+00
caf99f01-0000-70ce-38e0-7c627158bf81	98	Add Item Registration Attributes	This update adds data for the item registration attributes.	2026-07-24 18:00:00+00	2026-08-13 06:23:36.674309+00
caf99f01-0000-7116-f9de-ccad20cc8a96	38	Add Area Skill Settings	Adds the new area skill settings for skills like evil spirit, etc. to make them work properly again.	2024-10-25 19:00:00+00	2026-08-13 06:23:36.67144+00
caf99f01-0000-7183-bf31-97eaf7869e3a	18	Add duel configuration	This update adds data for the duel configuration	2024-07-11 20:00:00+00	2026-08-13 06:23:36.670157+00
caf99f01-0000-72b5-ddb3-d50cdd56237b	83	Add Random Experience Configuration Attributes	Adds new random experience Configuration attributes to the game configuration.	2026-04-27 20:00:00+00	2026-08-13 06:23:36.673411+00
caf99f01-0000-73df-0e02-2981157ea263	34	Fix Wings Damage Rates	This update fixes the wings damage absorption and increase bonus level tables values.	2023-10-08 16:00:00+00	2026-08-13 06:23:36.671112+00
caf99f01-0000-73e2-f09d-ec7f01012418	97	Finish Elf Master Tree PlugIn	This update completes the elf master tree and fixes some of its skill values. It also adds the missing extra projectile (4th) on some higher level (cross)bows.	2026-07-22 16:00:00+00	2026-08-13 06:23:36.674223+00
