caf99f01-0000-747d-e231-990f5fa51f7b	48	Fix Item Options And Attack Speed	This update fixes some item options (damage, defense rate), weapons attack speed, third wings defense, and some AA weapon values.	2025-03-05 16:00:00+00	2026-08-13 06:23:36.671737+00
caf99f01-0000-7497-b323-dffaf76f2a89	94	Add IsQuestItem flag	This update flags the existing quest items as such, so that they can only be picked up by characters with a matching active quest.	2026-07-10 20:50:00+00	2026-08-13 06:23:36.674008+00
