COPY config."ItemLevelBonusTable" ("Id", "GameConfigurationId", "Name", "Description") FROM stdin;
caf99f01-0000-717a-591a-7c1104b75462	00000001-0001-0000-0000-000000000000	Defense Increase (Armors)	Defines the defense increase per item level for armors. It's 3 per item level until level 9, then it's always 1 more for each level.
caf99f01-0000-71ff-8c4a-2860a61586cc	00000001-0001-0000-0000-000000000000	Mana Loss After Hit (Bolts/Arrows)	The mana loss per skill hit per ammunition item level due to infinity arrow efect.
caf99f01-0000-72e5-ab43-e0d2abea45ee	00000001-0001-0000-0000-000000000000	Transformation Ring Skins (Game Master Transformation Ring)	Contains the skin numbers for the different levels of the transformation ring (Game Master Transformation Ring).
caf99f01-0000-73f4-17b8-ee5309bbc52a	00000001-0001-0000-0000-000000000000	Scepter Rise (odd)	The scepter rise bonus per item level for odd magic power scepters.
caf99f01-0000-7404-19b0-c729670b883a	00000001-0001-0000-0000-000000000000	Transformation Ring Skins (Skeleton Transformation Ring)	Contains the skin numbers for the different levels of the transformation ring (Skeleton Transformation Ring).
caf99f01-0000-74d7-497e-813d6b2484b6	00000001-0001-0000-0000-000000000000	Transformation Ring Skins (Jack O'lantern Transformation Ring)	Contains the skin numbers for the different levels of the transformation ring (Jack O'lantern Transformation Ring).
caf99f01-0000-7574-219b-9c9d6d848b9e	00000001-0001-0000-0000-000000000000	Transformation Ring Skins (Snowman Transformation Ring)	Contains the skin numbers for the different levels of the transformation ring (Snowman Transformation Ring).
caf99f01-0000-7619-5075-314e300c75e5	00000001-0001-0000-0000-000000000000	Damage Increase (Weapons)	The damage increase by weapon level. It increases by 3 per level, and 1 more after level 10.
caf99f01-0000-7657-5c4e-1f03eb4b4ff1	00000001-0001-0000-0000-000000000000	Running Movement Speed	Defines the running movement speed for boots and underwater gloves from item level 5.
caf99f01-0000-77ce-8d56-7f535867c96a	00000001-0001-0000-0000-000000000000	Wing absorb	The damage absorb of wings per item level, 2 % less damage per level.
caf99f01-0000-77e1-ea3f-f2bd5beb1f0e	00000001-0001-0000-0000-000000000000	Elemental resistances (Jewelery)	Defines the elemental resistances for jewelery. It's 1 per item level.
caf99f01-0000-783f-7296-34f782dc2eb3	00000001-0001-0000-0000-000000000000	Transformation Ring Skins (Elite Skeleton Transformation Ring)	Contains the skin numbers for the different levels of the transformation ring (Elite Skeleton Transformation Ring).
caf99f01-0000-7848-a4ae-1afa44ee5343	00000001-0001-0000-0000-000000000000	Damage Increase (2nd Wings)	Defines the damage increase multiplier for second level wings. It's 1 % per wing level.
caf99f01-0000-7a25-bca3-40d78bc3a85f	00000001-0001-0000-0000-000000000000	Defense Bonus (1st and 2nd Wings)	Defines the defense bonus per level for 1st and 2nd level wings.
caf99f01-0000-7a41-1a29-a357a5e5ffef	00000001-0001-0000-0000-000000000000	Transformation Ring Skins (Panda Transformation Ring)	Contains the skin numbers for the different levels of the transformation ring (Panda Transformation Ring).
caf99f01-0000-7a5b-b90c-15be4dc4e341	00000001-0001-0000-0000-000000000000	Transformation Ring Skins (Christmas Transformation Ring)	Contains the skin numbers for the different levels of the transformation ring (Christmas Transformation Ring).
caf99f01-0000-7a95-bea2-a4b5028a6054	00000001-0001-0000-0000-000000000000	Defense Increase (Shields)	Defines the defense increase per item level for shields. It's always 1 per item level.
caf99f01-0000-7ae6-f093-e581cc708d81	00000001-0001-0000-0000-000000000000	Staff Rise (even)	The staff rise bonus per item level for even magic power staves.
caf99f01-0000-7b05-73db-bb1fda368e3d	00000001-0001-0000-0000-000000000000	Damage Increase % (Bolts/Arrows)	The damage increase % per ammunition item level.
caf99f01-0000-7b25-4b96-9033c3c1606b	00000001-0001-0000-0000-000000000000	Defense Bonus (3rd Wings)	Defines the defense bonus per level for 3rd level wings.
caf99f01-0000-7d75-c453-c3a940c6156c	00000001-0001-0000-0000-000000000000	Damage Increase (1st and 3rd Wings)	Defines the damage increase multiplier for first and third level wings. It's 2 % per wing level.
caf99f01-0000-7dfb-5737-fada09e79d8a	00000001-0001-0000-0000-000000000000	Transformation Ring Skins (Transformation Ring)	Contains the skin numbers for the different levels of the transformation ring (Transformation Ring).
caf99f01-0000-7e3f-0fa9-2830c898afda	00000001-0001-0000-0000-000000000000	Scepter Rise (even)	The scepter rise bonus per item level for even magic power scepters.
caf99f01-0000-7faa-d4c2-fab11b926c22	00000001-0001-0000-0000-000000000000	Staff Rise (odd)	The staff rise bonus per item level for odd magic power staves.
caf99f01-0000-7ff7-d5c3-78c39eb6aa36	00000001-0001-0000-0000-000000000000	Defense Rate Increase (Shields)	Defines the defense rate increase per item level for shields. It's 3 per item level until level 9, then it's always 1 more for each level.
\.
